026-07-17","created":"2026-07-22","description":"A Caldwell-based farm supply store is officially approved to open its first location in McCall.  On Thursday night, the McCall City Council unanimously voted to approve D&B Supply’s plans to open a store at 411 E. Deinhard Lane in a space formerly occupied by Rite Aid.  “It’s just good to finally see something trying to come […]","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},